    /* ── The meter with a mark, this theme's way [picked by Kenny on
       research/character-meter, round 3, 2026-10-05: shape 1, how the share
       arrives 1, the mark past the end 3; its tone is taped off and its
       loading is the lintel since 2026-10-07 23:44]. The package's own
       markup and states (setMeter(), js/kpi.js): the track on the meter,
       the share on ::before, the sign past the end or the loading picture on
       ::after, the mark `.kp-meter__mark`. Every animation and transition
       under prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference; still frames otherwise. ── */

