           falls into register on it [direction = the plate, opening = the
           plate]: it travels the closing spiral clockwise at an even pace,
           8 units, and stops dead in register. Its close is the same fall
           played backwards (js/motion.js plays a dialog's entrance in
           reverse), so a close is an open turned around, as everywhere else. */
