         because it would make every card the containing block of any
         fixed descendant a consumer puts in it;
       - the cut, extended outward through the shadow and applied to the
         panel itself. Taken.

       So the chamfer is carried past the box for the reach of the halo
       and the panel is clipped to it: the glow is cut along the same
       forty-five degrees the plate is, and stops dead at the corner. The
       clip is the field rather than a box — a rectangle `--kp-halo-field`
       out on every side with two bounded bites taken out of it, each
       joined to the edge by a zero-width seam, the island idiom this file
