       on research/size-motion, 2026-10-04]. js/motion.js marks a gliding box
       `[data-kp-resizing]` and what arrives in it `[data-kp-arriving]`. */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
        /* ── dark: the darkroom. The oxide halo glows while the box changes,
           and new content develops, from a pale print to its own contrast. ─ */
