       second copy of the label sliding up from below — needs two copies
       of the text in the DOM; the shared Button renderer emits one
       [finding, S49]. Kept instead: a bar rises from the bottom edge on
       hover/focus, the same "something arrives from below" gesture,
       CSS-only and content-free.
